self.KB_CONTENT["card:755123"]={"id":"card:755123","ty":"card","sourceId":"755123","title":"『合約訂單銷貨明細表』中的『選擇合約單號 (COP.TW001-TW002)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","銷貨","訂單","單號"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可勾選是否區間選擇，可自行選擇離散或區間。* 可點選 (icon)或[F2]合約訂單資料查詢，若空白表全部。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:753378"]={"id":"card:753378","ty":"card","sourceId":"753378","title":"『廠別資料建立作業』中的『E-Mail (MB008)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"帳號","keywords":["帳號","廠別"],"y":"other","answer":"* Internet，E-Mail帳號。* 可空白。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
